FIRST COMMERCIAL SHOOT

1121
00:42:32,054 --> 00:42:34,156
LEADS TO BACKSTAGE
BACK-STABBING.

1122
00:42:34,156 --> 00:42:37,793
WE HAVE THE SAME LINE AND I
THINK JAYLA STOLE MY SECRET.

1123
00:42:37,793 --> 00:42:39,362
AND BRIDGES ARE BURNED.

1124
00:42:39,362 --> 00:42:40,596
IT'S OKAY,
'CAUSE KARMA'S A BITCH.

1125
00:42:40,596 --> 00:42:43,499
AND THE FEUD BETWEEN LISA
AND CORYN BOILS OVER.

1126
00:42:43,499 --> 00:42:44,333
SHUT UP.

1127
00:42:44,333 --> 00:42:46,168
YOU'RE PRESENTING YOURSELF
LIKE A MORON.

1128
00:42:46,168 --> 00:42:47,236
ALCOHOLIC BITCH.

